	(text "USB-C input and power tree"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 22.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 4.5 4.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 40 90 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e638341-f6f7-5891-a321-e3771267624b")
	)
	(text "One USB-C port feeds four rails. Left of the barrier is USB ground (DGND); the analog stage floats on AGND = DUT minus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.0 26.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(italic yes)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ca9d25a-3b00-57c0-b13b-0b333bb57d8a")
	)
	(text "CC1 / CC2 5.1k pull-downs = USB-C sink. The MCU reads\nthe CC voltage to learn the source limit: 0.4 V = 500 mA\n(legacy source), 0.9 V = 1.5 A, 1.7 V = 3 A. Below 1.5 A\nfirmware keeps the fan slow and limits power to 55 W.\nShield to DGND: a metal enclosure is on the USB side;\nDUT terminals, heatsink hardware and the NTC lug must\nnot touch it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.54 153.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6b0c6971-bc61-5f21-bad2-d79ac11294ec")
	)
	(text "A   USB-C input: 5 V, data, current advertisement (CC)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.32 41.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f0dc54bd-8091-5232-92fc-89dcf10091c1")
	)
	(text "AGND (analog reference) meets PGND (DUT minus, source\nresistors) ONLY at NT1. Place NT1 at the centre of the four\nRs bottom pads: 1 mR between an Rs and NT1 is 10 mV at 10 A\n(4 % of full scale).\n\nBarrier: DGND side to AGND / PGND side. Rated 150 V DC\nworking (IEC 60664-1 functional, PD2, material group IIIb:\n1.6 mm creepage; IPC-2221B B2: 0.7 mm). Board rule 4 mm,\nno copper crosses on any layer. ISO7761 (5 kVrms, 8 mm) and\nthe 3 kVDC DC-DC exceed it by far. Float the load on a DUT\nreferenced within 150 V of earth; not for mains work."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.54 251.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "576bb9b6-f6b2-5b28-bfd5-054c16717108")
	)
	(text "D   Ground star point and the isolation barrier rating"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.32 180.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8764ad5a-3fc4-53a5-8e9f-3f035afb2ad1")
	)
	(text "+3V3: MCU, isolator side 1, pull-ups, LED. 60 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.54 95.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6a7480c2-8aa8-5e45-a5de-dc6e9f5f221e")
	)
	(text "+12V_FAN: 0.6 V x (1 + 191k / 10k) = 12.06 V, 0.3 A max = 0.8 A from USB.\nEN low: output sits at VBUS minus a diode and Q1 (block C) is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.54 167.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e253d27-3ced-5040-ba17-b7d118791330")
	)
	(text "BARRIER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 201.14 227.27 90)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(bold yes)
				(color 200 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7fe378fa-6f45-5812-bfcb-8b02752966d6")
	)
	(text "+12V_ISO: op-amps, comparators, pull-ups, 30 mA. PS1 is unregulated: 12 V\nat full load, up to 14 V here; all parts on the rail are rated 16 V or more.\nR12 / C8 filter the 100 kHz ripple (fc 1.5 kHz). +5V_ISO (MCP1703, 0.4 %):\nDAC, ADC, isolator side 2 and every threshold divider, so OTP, dropout,\nNTC-open and OVP thresholds do not depend on its absolute value.\nVERIFY the SIP-4 pin numbers of the DC-DC you buy before ordering the PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.54 247.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "104ce97d-8bf4-5abe-8ce3-c6646de725c5")
	)
	(text "B   Power tree: VBUS 5 V trunk, three branches, four rails"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 159.48 36.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f97f1f16-5721-5b3d-8adb-3cc7a3886fa9")
	)
	(text "J2 = PC fan pinout: 1 GND, 2 +12 V,\n3 tach (open collector, pulled to 3.3 V),\n4 PWM 25 kHz. 2- and 3-wire fans use\npins 1 to 3, on/off only. Q3 drives PWM\nopen-drain: firmware inverts the duty.\nR11 only for fans without a PWM pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320.54 171.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d5ad2f8-3227-52ad-94d1-5e02bfe5f2ff")
	)
	(text "C   Fan switch and connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 311.88 45.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a224e2d-47ff-5702-93b9-c3c67b524735")
	)
